    "description": "Family of mains-powered, single-interval, automatic weighing instruments designated the TS420 Series, operating as checkweighers (Category X). The instruments comprise a cabinet, touch screen user interface (HMI), in-feed and out-feed conveyors, weighing unit with weigh conveyor, mechanical handling facilities and sorting devices; they may be equipped with a metal detector. Models are designated 420 Series with prefixes describing the associated functions (Sentinel 420 stand alone, Cerberus 420 metal detection, Theia 420 X-ray). Constructed in stainless steel with a fabricated floor-standing frame on adjustable feet; conveyors' type and size are not restricted. Designed to weigh packs dynamically over a continuously running weigh conveyor, with independently adjustable in-feed, weigh and out-feed conveyor speeds."
